            "duties": "Fr. Mark is serving as Head Pastor of St. Thérèse the Little Flower & the St. Carlo Acutis Catholic Student Center, serving alongside Fr. Todd VanderMay.",
            "bio": "Fr. Mark was born in Rapid City, SD, and grew up in the Black Hills. He attended St. Martin's College in Lacey, WA, and graduated with a degree in Philosophy. He then attended Mount Angel Seminary in St. Benedict, OR, where he earned a Master of Divinity degree. Fr. Mark was ordained to the priesthood on May 30, 1999, and has served in various parishes throughout the Diocese of Rapid City."
