            "photo": "/Kevin-Baltzer.jpg",
            "photoPosition": "center 35%",
            "photoFit": "cover",
            "duties": "I'm in charge of Adult & Family Ministry, which is being taught on Wednesdays — see the \"Faith Formation\" tab for more information.\nI'm also the staff designated IT guy who built this new website and will keep it running and updated!",
            "bio": "Growing up on a farm southwest of Huron, SD, I earned my Chemical Engineering degree from South Dakota Mines before spending three years as a full-time missionary with FOCUS Catholic. Today, I serve as the Director of Evangelization and Adult & Family Formation at St. Thérèse the Little Flower Parish in Rapid City. Driven by a love for classical learning and Catholic youth formation, \n\nI currently live in the Rapid Valley area with my wife Katie and daughter Lucia."
